  "notes": "Needs MIDI FLT > CTRL CHG = ENABLE. CC numbers are the factory CC MAP (GLOBAL > CC MAP can change them). CCs act on the timbre of their channel: timbre 1 on the global channel, timbre 2 on T2MIDI.CH in MULTI mode. NRPNs (arp, voice mode, vocoder, virtual patch) go to the global channel and use only the Data Entry MSB. Values from the German manual's MIDI chapter, untested. Level and pan of the 16 vocoder bands, NRPN MSB 4, LSB 64–79 and 80–95 (pan centred). The other vocoder parameters have no CC until one is assigned in CC MAP.",
